      "created_at": "2022-03-31T14:07:32.148Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My game recently updated itself, changing the thumbnail from the EE-era Baron Blade picture to the one featured in the third episode of the podcast.  That would be fine, but another effect of the update seems to have been that the log.txt file is no longer in the same place, or doesn’t have the same name, or something of that nature.  So how can I now find the game log that saves automatically after each game?  I use this feature regularly, and it’s a huge problem for me that the update apparently broke it.  (I’m on an Android phone, if that matters.)</p>",
