      "created_at": "2022-04-01T07:24:38.937Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, for both this one and the one I found myself, I can install the app, but as soon as I open it, Google takes me to a radio button which says, “Allow app to access files; app may delete files without your explicit permission.”. So that’s not acceptable.  Can anyone tell me how to find files on my phone <em>without</em> giving an app the blanket permission to erase all my data anytime an algorithm tells it to?</p>",
